SUMMARY:MIT / French Library Author Series: Before I Forget with Anne Pauly
LOCATION:MIT\, 77 Massachusetts Ave\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Anne Pauly is a Paris-based French writer and winner of the Pri
 x du Livre Inter and Prix Robert Walser. Her debut novel\, Before I Forget
 \, was also shortlisted for the Prix Goncourt\, Prix Femina\, and Prix Wep
 ler. Before turning to fiction\, she worked as a journalist and wrote on m
 usic\, feminism\, queer culture\, and literature.\nhttps://calendar.mit.ed
 u/event/mit-french-library-author-series-before-i-forget-with-anne-pauly\n
 From Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
